Package: tennisplayercareer
Title: Representing a Tennis Player's Career and Comparing Their Age to Their Opponents
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
	person("Chloe", "O'Meany-Lucas", email = "chloe.jxix@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package extracts a professional tennis player's from Tennis Abstract and creates a table and plot. The table is used to create a plot that shows a timeline of the player's wins and losses throughout their career, as well as the age they were compared to their opponent's on the day of the match.
